  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iribarren Municipality Flood Emergency Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide support in several inter-related aspects that have an overall positive impact for the affected population: WASH items will help prevent the spread of waterborne diseases as well as skin diseases due to lack of proper hygiene and water sources contamination and will help prevent the spread of COVID-19; primary health services (medical consultation plus medication) will help to treat acute diseases related to poor hygiene (parasites, skin infections, etc) and aid in the control of chronic non-communicable diseases, both of which can lead to complications that can cause limited functionality and dependence; food item provision to help reduce the risk of malnutrition, anemia and other health conditions that can have serious consequences for the health of the affected population.</narrative>
  </description>
